blocks.explanation:
Mashkook downloads mein virus ya spyware chhupe ho sakte hain jo:
- computer ko nuqsan pohanchate ya slow karte hain;
- chupke se be-ijazat data jama aur chori karte hain;
- dhoke (scam) ya shanakht ki chori (identity theft) ka sabab bante hain.
Download se pehle source check karein aur antivirus use karein.
